/T (The caller sends a bearer session token. The backend hashes it, finds a non-expired session, checks household ownership, validates financial inputs and writes the plan/snapshots transactionally. Login/session restoration returns the saved household state. Passwords are salted scrypt hashes; original passwords are not returned in account responses. Logout revokes the session. Sessions expire after 12 hours and are durable across server restarts.)
