/T (storage.save_family uses BEGIN IMMEDIATE, parameterized SQL and an atomic update. A final repair serializes schema initialization and avoids changing an already-WAL database journal mode during concurrent first requests. A new eight-thread fresh-database test verifies one successful insert and seven unique-key rejections, with no storage failure in that test. This is focused validation, not evidence of high-load or multi-host safety.)
